Are you sure that the problem is a data type? According to a quick
search on Google, Netezza seems to support booleans.

I would give a try to the RNetezza package. And it is probably easier
to modify that package to solve any data type issues between R and the
database. Besides that, there's little I can do to help, because
Netezza is proprietary software and I don't have access to it.

